*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0008
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 766
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0008.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY LON0008C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM TERM IN YEARS
    05 T-CP               PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 WS-ELG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "T-CP=" T-CP
    DISPLAY "WS-ELG=" WS-ELG
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF C-AG-YY >= 18
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN C-AG-YY > 65
                MOVE 10 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ELG
            *> MEDIUM TERM CAP
            WHEN C-AG-YY > 50
                MOVE 20 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ELG
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ELG
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO WS-ELG
    END-IF.
